  - key: hud.role_goal.human
    tr: "Bah\u00E7ede ev anahtar\u0131n\u0131 bul, iyi cinin okudu\u011Fu referanslarla bulmacalar\u0131 \u00E7\u00F6z,\nmahzende hazineyi g\u00FCn do\u011Fmadan kaz. 3 kez bay\u0131l\u0131rsan kaybedersin."
    en: "Find the house key in the garden, solve the puzzles with the references the good jinn reads,\ndig the treasure in the cellar before sunrise. Fainting 3 times loses the round."
  - key: hud.role_goal.good_jinn
    tr: "Ruh Perdesi'ni a\u00E7\u0131p (Sa\u011F T\u0131k) referanslar\u0131 insana anlat, lambalar\u0131 yak,\nk\u00F6t\u00FC cinleri kov ve bayg\u0131n insan\u0131 kolonyayla ay\u0131lt."
    en: "Open the Spirit Veil (Right Click) and tell the human the references, light the lamps,\nexorcise the evil jinns and revive the fainted human with cologne."
  - key: hud.role_goal.evil_jinn
    tr: "E\u015Fyalara girip insan\u0131 3 kez bay\u0131lt ya da g\u00FCn do\u011Fana kadar oyala.\nBulmacalar\u0131 toplu sabote et, lambalar\u0131 patlat; tak\u0131m arkada\u015F\u0131nla b\u00F6l\u00FCn."
    en: "Possess objects and make the human faint 3 times, or stall until sunrise.\nScramble the puzzles, burst the lamps; split up with your teammate."
  - key: hud.role_goal.none
    tr: ""
    en: ""
